      "description": "DEFEND THE UNIVERSE!\n\nGalaxy Invader brings the golden age of arcade gaming to your Apple Watch with stunning neon visuals.\n\nHOW TO PLAY:\n\nPilot: Rotate the Digital Crown to move your ship left and right.\n\nFire: Your ship shoots automatically. Aim for the aliens!\n\nDodge: Avoid incoming enemy fire. One hit and it's game over.\n\nWHY PLAY?\n\nRetro Vibes: 8-bit pixel art with a modern synthwave twist.\n\nCrown Control: Precise analog movement for pro gamers.\n\nHaptic Feedback: Feel every explosion on your wrist.\n\nThe aliens are coming. Download Galaxy Invader now!",
